\]

Next, add the time required to saute 80 clams (which is already accounted for in the initial condition):
\[
\text{Total time} = \text{Time to peel 80 clams} + \text{Time to saute 80 clams}
= 8 \text{ minutes} + 11 \text{ minutes} = 19 \text{ minutes}
\]

Therefore, the total time it will take Beatriz to peel and saute 80 clams is:
\boxed{19}
